  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"正在存錢買筆電！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/W6Xlp26Z/images/2a6e8a58eabac85320c1a70fa1f1ffb6a63caa27.png\" alt=\"Crate Delight: Croptopia\"></p>\n<p><strong><br>為 Crate Delight 增添 Croptopia 的儲存方案！</strong><br>此 <strong>Crate Delight</strong> 擴充模組新增了專用的木箱與袋子，用於存放所有 <strong>Croptopia</strong> 的作物與物品。非常適合想要整理農場與儲藏室的玩家。</p>\n<h2>🌽 功能特色：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>木箱：</strong>可存放 <strong>洋薊</strong>、<strong>甜椒</strong>、<strong>玉米</strong>、<strong>黑莓</strong>、<strong>番茄</strong> 等眾多作物。</li>\n<li><strong>袋子：</strong>適合存放較小的食材，如 <strong>黑豆</strong>、<strong>藍莓</strong>、<strong>米</strong>、<strong>橄欖</strong>、<strong>花生</strong> 等眾多食材。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>✨ 無縫整合：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>只需收集 Croptopia 的物品，即可開始製作木箱或袋子。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/croptopia\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此下載 Croptopia。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>❤️ 支持我：</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>透過 <a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/bn9fZ\" rel=\"nofollow\">建立自己的 Minecraft 伺服器</a>&nbsp;、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\">使用 PayPal 捐贈</a>&nbsp;，或在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon 上支持我</a>，來支持 <strong>Crate Delight</strong>&nbsp;及其擴充模組的開發。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐贈按鈕\"></a></p>",
